{%- comment -%}
  lb-collection-lcp-preload.liquid
  Version:      2.0.0
  Last updated: 2026-08-21
  Status:       Intentionally no-op.

  Collection LCP preloading is already owned by
  snippets/chaos_unleashed_lcp_preload.liquid, rendered through
  chaos_unleashed_master. That implementation mirrors the actual product-card
  media widths/sizes and handles variant-aware featured media.

  Keeping a second preload path here created competing high-priority requests
  with a different srcset/sizes model. This compatibility snippet remains only
  because layout/theme.liquid renders it.

  Search pages intentionally receive no speculative product-image preload until
  their actual LCP candidate is measured; a wrong high-priority image is worse
  than normal parser discovery.
{%- endcomment -%}
